  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade with Impact</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to build a consortium concluding of Dutch trading companies that operate in Egypt in the sectors of seed, (seed-)potato, vegetables and fruits that develop a portfolio of impact projects in the field of Climate and Water Smart Agriculture (CaWSA), that lead to:1.	Business-driven country-support: a win-win setup, local economic development and Dutch earning capacity in order to create lasting impact;2.	Collectivity in impact-projects;3.	Enhanced corporate impact-effort abroad (CSR);4.	Enhanced business-awareness of societies&#x2019; changing attitude towards global trade, and address the main underpinning issues of environmental and social sustainability/accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
